# Keep the build context small and keep secrets out of the image.
#
# .env matters most: Vite would read it during the build and bake whatever it
# holds into the bundle. Configuration is passed as --build-arg instead, so
# what a given image contains is visible in the build command.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules
dist
coverage
.vite

*.log
.DS_Store
.git
.gitignore
README.md
